; Property-management accruals are kept separate from insurance schedules.

; 2022-2025 四年欠缴共 6000 CNY；2026 年 5 月补缴其中两年 3000 CNY。
; 2026 年应缴 1500 CNY，按月计提 125 CNY。
2026-01-01 * "期初录入" "补录历史所欠的四年物业费（2022-2025）" ^property-arrears-2022-2025
    Liabilities:AccruedExpenses:Family:PropertyManagement     -6000.00 CNY
    Equity:Opening-Balances                                    6000.00 CNY

2026-01-31 * "物业费计提" "2026-01 月度物业费" ^property-fee-2026
    Expenses:Family:Housing:PropertyManagement                  125.00 CNY
